 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.54,
   "text": "What would the world be like if the landmasses were instantly rotated by 90 degrees?",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 4.12,
   "end": 9.34,
   "text": "It would profoundly alter our world in general, and the weirdly Minnesota-heavy world of 1990s",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 9.34,
   "end": 10.32,
   "text": "cinema in particular.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 10.68,
   "end": 13.76,
   "text": "We're assuming that all the material is magically shifted around, so there are no",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 13.76,
   "end": 15.14,
   "text": "massive tsunamis or earthquakes.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 15.64,
   "end": 17.98,
   "text": "Even so, it would definitely still be a catastrophe.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 18.48,
   "end": 21.6,
   "text": "The ice caps would melt long before new ones could develop, pushing the ocean up",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 21.6,
   "end": 22.42,
   "text": "by a few hundred feet.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 22.72,
   "end": 26.08,
   "text": "The reshuffling of climate zones would come as a huge shock to the biosphere, leading",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 26.08,
   "end": 28.64,
   "text": "to ecological chaos and possibly mass extinctions.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.1,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.0
  },
  {
   "start": 28.64,
   "end": 33.06,
   "text": "But, if the shift happened just right, and if Michael Bay were telling the story, then,",
   "avg_logprob": -0.144,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 33.42,
   "end": 37.3,
   "text": "as the waters of the Gulf of Mexico began to cool, and the Mississippi slowed and became",
   "avg_logprob": -0.144,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 37.3,
   "end": 39.98,
   "text": "an estuary, the region's wildlife would spread inland.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.144,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 40.52,
   "end": 44.64,
   "text": "And one morning, all those Minnesotans we know from 90s cinema would wake up to the site",
   "avg_logprob": -0.144,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 44.64,
   "end": 49.14,
   "text": "of floating rafts of fire ants, followed by 5 million lost hungry alligators who would",
   "avg_logprob": -0.144,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 49.14,
   "end": 51.62,
   "text": "wallow in the mighty docks now melted skating rink.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.144,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 51.9,
   "end": 55.7,
   "text": "Add yet more for the characters and grumpy old men to complain about, and lead to a",
   "avg_logprob": -0.144,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.01
  },
  {
   "start": 55.7,
   "end": 59.24,
   "text": "similarly gruesome, if more reptilian, ending to the movie Fargo.",
   "avg_logprob": -0.323,
   "no_speech_prob": 0.032
  }
 ],
